{"id":"n58111-1-2","stage":0,"title":"다섯 · 五","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58111-1-2-1","ko":"여기 상자에 초콜릿이 열 개가 있었는데 반이나 먹어 버렸어.","zh":"这里的盒子里原本有十块巧克力，可是已经吃掉了一半呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"여기","meaning":"这里，这儿","explanation":"여기：这里，这儿","readings":[{"term":"여기","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17863","senseId":"1","lemma":"여기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"상자에","meaning":"箱子","explanation":"상자：箱子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"상자","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62801","senseId":"1","lemma":"상자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"초콜릿이","meaning":"巧克力","explanation":"초콜릿：巧克力；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"초콜릿","audio":"/audio/a5b7c153024714c016fa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72128","senseId":"1","lemma":"초콜릿","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"열","meaning":"十","explanation":"열：十","readings":[{"term":"열","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67805","senseId":"1","lemma":"열","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개가","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있었는데","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"반이나","meaning":"一半，半","explanation":"반：一半，半；이나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57623","senseId":"1","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹어","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"버렸어.","meaning":"完","explanation":"버리다：完；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"버리다","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62601","senseId":"1","lemma":"버리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"c13089162f79c617","term":"여기","zh":"这里，这儿","audio":"/audio/c13089162f79c61744a9.mp3","entryId":"17863","definition":"指代与说话人较近的地方。","pronunciation":["여기"]},{"id":"e6bb1dea433d8fa4","term":"상자","zh":"箱子","audio":"/audio/e6bb1dea433d8fa4cdb5.mp3","entryId":"62801","definition":"存放东西的木制或纸制四方形筒。","pronunciation":["상자"]},{"id":"a5b7c153024714c0","term":"초콜릿","zh":"巧克力","audio":"/audio/a5b7c153024714c016fa.mp3","entryId":"72128","definition":"一种在可可粉中掺入牛奶、糖等而制成的黑色甜品。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"6f4112362e973dd6","term":"열","zh":"十","audio":"/audio/6f4112362e973dd65e65.mp3","entryId":"67805","definition":"九加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["열ː"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物、物体等存在的状态。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"一半，半","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57623","definition":"平均分成两个后的其中一个。","pronunciation":["반ː"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"51654377be6bf0a0","term":"버리다","zh":"完","audio":"/audio/51654377be6bf0a0810e.mp3","entryId":"62601","definition":"表示前面所说的行动已完全结束。","pronunciation":["버리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1fa7b57917bb1b7db0bc.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n58111-1-2-2","ko":"이제 다섯이 남았네.","zh"